s a Qualifications?",[236,237,238,242,245],"ul",{},[239,240,241],"li",{},"An access level protected entity with a \"public\" (as in \"anyone can see\") facing name and description.",[239,243,244],{},"A training\u002Fmodule that someone has been \"granted\" or has succcessfully taken the test for.",[239,246,247],{},"A qualification can require certain prerequisites. A prerequisite can be a job rank, other successful qualification.",[249,250,252],"h3",{"id":251},"what-elements-are-needed","What elements are needed?",[236,254,255,266,269,272],{},[239,256,257,258],{},"Qualification: Holds all basic infos about the qualification.\n",[236,259,260,263],{},[239,261,262],{},"Access: Holds the access levels to the qualification.",[239,264,265],{},"Requirements: Requirements to be able to take the qualification. -> Don't deny the access to the qualification like access, but are required to send a request or to take the qualification.",[239,267,268],{},"Requests: List of user requests to take the test for the qualification.",[239,270,271],{},"Results: A \"mapping\" of score of an user test.",[239,273,274,275],{},"Tests: Test progress of (started) tests from users.\n",[236,276,277,280,283],{},[239,278,279],{},"Info\u002FConfig of the Test: E.g., how many questions need to be right to pass, how much time do they have, etc.",[239,281,282],{},"Test Questions: Questions for the qualification tests.",[239,284,285],{},"User Test Answers: Answered questions \"waiting for approval\" by a \"trainer\".",[249,287,289],{"id":288},"access-levels","Access Levels",[223,291,292],{},"Similarily structured to documents access levels.",[236,294,295,298,301,304,307,310],{},[239,296,297],{},"Blocked.",[239,299,300],{},"View.",[239,302,303],{},"Request.",[239,305,306],{},"Take.",[239,308,309],{},"Grade.",[239,311,312],{},"Edit.",[231,314,316],{"id":315},"exams","Exams",[223,318,319],{},"3 modes for a qualification with an exam:",[236,321,322,325,328],{},[239,323,324],{},"Disabled.",[239,326,327],{},"